{"id":813207,"title":"04｜数据清洗和解析对RAG的影响和解决方案","content":"RAG产品的成功关键在于高质量的数据清洗与解析。首先，复杂文档如金融年报的处理需特别注意，传统Chunking方法不适用，因为简单分割会破坏语义连贯性。为此，需采用专门模型识别文档结构，包括标题、段落、页眉等，并对文本换行进行二次判定以避免干扰Embedding生成。对于表格和图表，还需进一步使用表格结构识别模型，确保单元格边界及表头定义准确无误。当前解决方案基于目标检测技术，但未来将探索Transformer架构以提升上限。此外，向量数据库的选择也至关重要，尽管它简化了搜索引擎功能，但在精确搜索方面仍面临挑战。综上所述，通过优化数据处理流程并选择合适的向量数据库，可以显著提高RAG系统的性能。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":394766,"user_name":"Geek_062c17","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":3970287,"ip_address":"福建","ucode":"40E889138F20EA","user_header":"","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1728229133,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":143371,"content":"等过段时间后，组委会觉得没问题，可以放出来。目前根据视频已经可以获取完整的pdf信息了 ","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1478717,"ctime":1728552927,"ip_address":"上海","comment_id":394766,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":3,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100824301,"comment_content":"老师，您这个课件ppt能分享一份吗","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1478717,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/16/90/3d/791d0f5e.jpg","nickname":"Yingfeng","note":"","ucode":"5F8CCEC7B3D925","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":652259,"discussion_content":"等过段时间后，组委会觉得没问题，可以放出来。目前根据视频已经可以获取完整的pdf信息了 ","content_length":44,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1728552927,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"上海","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]},{"author":{"id":1478717,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/16/90/3d/791d0f5e.jpg","nickname":"Yingfeng","note":"","ucode":"5F8CCEC7B3D925","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_med